/*
  SessionComparisonChart.strings
  TeslaSync — P4 feature view · 0089 · SessionComparisonChart (Apple)

  The P1/S10 i18n catalog contribution for this surface. Every key the native
  `SessionComparisonChart` resolves (table "SessionComparisonChart") lives here with
  its web `t(key, default)` English value. These entries fold into the app
  `Localizable.xcstrings` master catalog at integration time; they are kept in a
  per-surface table so each parallel surface prompt owns its own strings without
  editing the shared catalog.

  The first group is the exact keys extracted from the web source
  (features/charging/components/charging-curve/SessionComparisonChart.tsx). The
  remainder back the charger labels (web `getChargerLabel`), the native state
  envelope (freshness chip, connectivity banner, loading / empty / error chrome), and
  the chart axes / accessibility summaries.
*/

